1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south, witnessing
the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 14=

34
00:01:58,280 --> 00:02:00,240
Something's wrong!

35
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:00,960
- What happened?
- Something's wrong!

36
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,280
Mr. Ke!

37
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,280
Mr. Ke has gone mad!

38
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:04,960
Whoa!

39
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,640
Who beat you up like this?

40
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:07,960
I...

41
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,640
I put on some rouge

42
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:12,680
just to meet Her Majesty.

43
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,560
Your Maj...

44
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:15,680
Huh?

45
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,800
Who knocked Her Majesty out?

46
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,480
Oh.

47
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,480
She's just being down-to-earth.

48
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,400
Don't bother her.

49
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,360
Let's go take a look.

50
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,720
Oh.

51
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:24,720
Oh no!

52
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,000
Hey!

53
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:25,840
Oh.

54
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,600
Hey, hey!

55
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Don't, sir!

56
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:31,840
What are you doing?

57
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,000
Don't scare me!

58
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,920
Father!

59
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:34,960
Father!

60
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,640
Ah!

61
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:37,120
Don't, sir!

62
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,040
Help!

63
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:38,440
Ah!

64
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,640
Whoa!

65
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,720
Mr. Ke has gone mad!

66
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,720
Holy Monk!

67
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,920
Please save my father!

68
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,640
Huh?

69
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,360
Hey, hey!

70
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:53,920
Xiuyuan.

71
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:54,960
You're finally here!

72
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,720
Mr. Ke's like a rabid dog,

73
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:58,040
biting everyone in sight

74
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,560
and eating their hearts!

75
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:00,840
Sir!

76
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,440
I'm still so young!

77
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,720
Help!

78
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:05,960
Help!

79
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:06,720
You can't escape!

80
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,080
He was fine two hours ago.

81
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,280
How did this happen?

82
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,560
- Maybe he's hungry again.
- Watch out for your drool!

83
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,280
I know!

84
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,120
Ah!

85
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,680
You knew? Why didn't you say so?

86
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,120
Hey!

87
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,280
Darling!

88
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:37,640
Go!

89
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:46,480
A giant drumstick!

90
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,400
I don't taste good!

91
00:03:58,960 --> 00:03:59,960
H-Hey!

92
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,720
Stay back!

93
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:01,800
Don't come any closer!

94
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:04,920
Hey!

95
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,120
Wow!

96
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,760
Hey, hey!

97
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,440
Look!

98
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,320
Oh!

99
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:10,120
My spiritual power is back!

100
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,840
Congratulations!

101
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,920
Dream on.

102
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,040
It's you?

103
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,920
Surprised?

104
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:20,120
I'm the one who restored it.

105
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:20,880
Monk!

106
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,760
Where did you hide the Linglong Pagoda?

107
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:23,280
Whoa!

108
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,240
Whatever you do, don't tell her

109
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,920
the pagoda's at Lingyin Temple...

110
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,360
Shut up!

111
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:30,040
I'll help you take her down.

112
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,120
Then free my benefactor.

113
00:04:31,280 --> 00:04:32,120
Oh, come on!

114
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,520
I already told you,

115
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:35,760
the Three-Headed Jiao has committed
terrible sins.

116
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,800
We can't let him out.

117
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,040
No.

118
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,080
Fine, fine.

119
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:41,920
Then carry on.

120
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,320
What?

121
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,400
Some friend you are!

122
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,680
You're no friend at all!

123
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,000
Oh no!

124
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,160
Holy Monk!

125
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,520
Zhaocai and Jinbao have gone mad!

126
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,480
- Holy Monk, help!
- Ah!

127
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,360
My father's gone mad!

128
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,040
I'm in no position to save anyone!

129
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:01,720
Whoa!

130
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,960
Run!

131
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,160
Hurry!

132
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,280
The lunatic's over there!

133
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,440
Oh!

134
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:07,440
Perfect timing!

135
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:08,600
- Someone's gone mad over there!
- Take him away first.

136
00:05:08,600 --> 00:05:09,080
What?

137
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,400
You've got the wrong guy!

138
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,440
Why are you arresting me?

139
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,480
I'm faking it!

140
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,720
They're the crazy ones!

141
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,480
Stop!

142
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,560
Stay back!

143
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,560
Stay back!

144
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:26,800
Amitabha Buddha.

145
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,080
Greetings, Senior Brother.

146
00:05:42,880 --> 00:05:43,360
Benefactor!

147
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,520
Benefactor!

148
00:05:44,650 --> 00:05:47,470
(Linglong Pagoda)

149
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:51,600
Your wife's here.

150
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:52,720
(Linglong Pagoda)

151
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,600
My wife?

152
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,360
Where is she?

153
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,960
How dare you lie to me, little monk!

154
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:58,520
Benefactor!

155
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,680
It's me.

156
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,560
I think I've found Ke Ayao.

157
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Before long,

158
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:04,080
you'll be able to get out.

159
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:04,960
Oh.

160
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,200
No need to go through all that.

161
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:09,120
Turns out this pagoda has a password.

162
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,520
It's written on the bottom.

163
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,120
Just say the password,

164
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,320
and I can get out.

165
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,800
Password?

166
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:18,360
Oh.

167
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,800
There really are words down here.

168
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,640
(Linglong Pagoda)
It's the monk's new password.

169
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:25,720
Just say it out loud,

170
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,000
and the pagoda will open.

171
00:06:27,400 --> 00:06:27,760
Oh.

172
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,440
Okay.

173
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,360
Mm.

174
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:36,000
New Lingyin Temple team is the best!

175
00:06:37,440 --> 00:06:38,280
What's going on?

176
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:39,800
What kind of password is that?

177
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:41,040
It's an alarm!

178
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:47,880
(Linglong Pagoda)

179
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:52,400
(Linglong Pagoda)

180
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:53,640
The alarm's going off!

181
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:54,040
Quick!

182
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:04,440
Huh?

183
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,760
(Linglong Pagoda)
How did you get in here too?

184
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,240
A demon got sucked inside!

185
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,400
Go get Master!

186
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:11,000
Okay!

187
00:07:11,960 --> 00:07:13,760
Go, go, go!

188
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,680
Hmph.

189
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,760
How dare you, Li Xiuyuan!

190
00:07:17,878 --> 00:07:18,892
(Yamen)

191
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,320
(Silence)
You escaped custody last time.

192
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,520
This time,

193
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,680
I will make you pay dearly for this!

194
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,000
I didn't do anything!

195
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,280
What gives you the right to hit me?

196
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:27,800
Hmph.

197
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:30,600
You made a pass at the Jade Empress

198
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,240
and angered the Jade Emperor,

199
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,920
who sent down heavenly punishment.

200
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:35,360
As a result, people in Lin'an City

201
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,400
went mad

202
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,320
and started biting people.

203
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,840
Guards!

204
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,720
Bring out the torture instruments!

205
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:44,200
Wait, wait!

206
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:46,520
You're just a mortal official.

207
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:47,000
How do you know

208
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,040
Heaven's top secret?

209
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,440
Hmph.

210
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,560
The Jade Emperor's celestial envoy

211
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:54,200
told me himself.

212
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:54,840
Oh.

213
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,200
Wow.

214
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:59,160
I'm on a case for the Jade Emperor!

215
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,840
I'm really moving up in the world!

216
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:02,200
Celestial Envoy?

217
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,000
- Mm.
- Mm.

218
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,520
Mm.

219
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:06,560
That's me.

220
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,120
You?

221
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:13,240
Well, well!

222
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,640
What a surprise!

223
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:16,040
So it's Erlang Shen,

224
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:18,600
second only to me in looks and brains!

225
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,320
Mm.

226
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,760
I have to admit,

227
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,760
my looks do attract attention.

228
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:23,320
But

229
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,680
you should know

230
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:26,920
this was entirely Her Majesty's doing.

231
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:29,600
Don't frame me and ruin my good name.

232
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,720
You rotten monk!

233
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,320
You're shameless!

234
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,440
You're about to die,

235
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,360
and you're still saying that?

236
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,080
Listen.

237
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,080
You stole my Linglong Pagoda last time

238
00:08:37,080 --> 00:08:38,760
and the Jade Emperor chewed me out.

239
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,120
Today,

240
00:08:42,400 --> 00:08:43,080
you're dead.

241
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:43,520
Hey!

242
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:46,040
When will this cycle of revenge end?

243
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,920
- Right?
- Only sacrificing this rotten monk

244
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,800
will calm the Jade Emperor's fury

245
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,640
and lift the heavenly punishment.

246
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,320
Mm.

247
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,280
Guards!

248
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,920
Bring out the torture instruments!

249
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:55,440
Hmph.

250
00:08:56,760 --> 00:09:03,680
Let me go!

251
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:04,640
Hmph.

252
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:05,680
Light the fire! Sacrifice him to Heaven!

253
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,160
Hey! No!

254
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,440
You'll really kill me!

255
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:10,000
Hey!

256
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:10,840
Stop lighting it!

257
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:11,200
Hey!

258
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,720
Come on!

259
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:14,480
Stop!

260
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:22,840
Hey.

261
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:23,840
You're okay now?

262
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,680
I'm okay.

263
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,360
That's great!

264
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,120
My jaw's just a little sore.

265
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:29,320
Insolent demon!

266
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:31,440
You defied the Jade Emperor's decree!

267
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,280
How do you answer for that?

268
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,600
Hey!

269
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,120
I told you,

270
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,040
I'm a celestial maiden,

271
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,160
not a demon!

272
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:38,760
(Justice Prevails)
Demon!

273
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,560
I'm not!

274
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:40,000
Demon!

275
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,040
What are you waiting for?

276
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,760
Light it!

277
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,760
I know!

278
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,800
They didn't go mad

279
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,600
because of heavenly punishment.

280
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,400
Not heavenly punishment?

281
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,000
Then what?

282
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:49,720
They went mad

283
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,080
because they all used rouge.

284
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:56,280
Sir.

285
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,520
We've detained everyone who went mad.

286
00:09:59,120 --> 00:09:59,560
Most of them

287
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:01,160
were at the Ke residence tonight.

288
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:03,440
The rest are their wives, daughters,
or maids.

289
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:04,880
Exactly.

290
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:06,100
They all used

291
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:08,080
Mr. Ke's rouge.

292
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:09,760
Well,

293
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:11,400
the Jade Emperor himself gave the order,

294
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:12,280
and you dare defy it?

295
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:12,960
Tell me,

296
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,520
you tried to seduce Her Majesty.

297
00:10:14,520 --> 00:10:15,680
How do you explain that?

298
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,800
Because she used the rouge too.

299
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:20,920
But she has spiritual power,

300
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,640
so she didn't start biting people.

301
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:24,080
As for Piaopiao,

302
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,520
she has spiritual power too,

303
00:10:25,520 --> 00:10:27,680
so she recovered this quickly.

304
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:30,200
Oh.

305
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:32,120
That's true.

306
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,280
As for the heavenly punishment,

307
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:36,320
there's only one truth:

308
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,520
you lied.

309
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,320
Pah!

310
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:40,960
Nonsense!

311
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:41,560
Hmm.

312
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,680
How could a little box of rouge

313
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,560
mess with Her Majesty's mind?

314
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:45,200
Hmph.

315
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:46,200
Oh?

316
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,280
If you don't believe me,

317
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,560
try it yourself.

318
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:50,840
Hmm.

319
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:53,240
Fine.

320
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:56,840
I'll try it.

321
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,120
I don't believe

322
00:10:58,400 --> 00:10:59,240
some measly rouge

323
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,720
could make me go mad.

324
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:07,240
Oh.

325
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,600
Oh.

326
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,680
I'm fine, right?

327
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:11,160
Huh?

328
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:12,240
I'm fine.

329
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,200
Ah.

330
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:14,880
You rotten monk!

331
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,920
What do you have to say now?

332
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:19,560
Hmm.

333
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,400
Celestial Envoy?

334
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:24,560
Celestial Envoy?

335
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:30,640
You lunatic!

336
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,520
Stay away!

337
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:45,640
Help!

338
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:51,240
Mr. Ke and the others are in jail.

339
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,840
Shouldn't we be going there?

340
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,640
Why are we here?

341
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:58,200
Everyone except Ms. Ke

342
00:11:58,200 --> 00:11:59,240
has gone mad.

343
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,560
So she's

344
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,440
our only lead.

345
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:02,880
Mm.

346
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:04,760
Oh.

347
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,040
Shen Lang.

348
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,560
How's my father?

349
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,480
The authorities called a doctor.

350
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:15,400
He should be fine soon.

351
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,080
I made you a calming tonic myself.

352
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:19,960
Mm.

353
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,200
Take your medicine

354
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,720
and get some rest.

355
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,160
Ms. Ke.

356
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:56,710
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

357
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:59,970
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

358
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:03,770
♪Everything I own is worn and
weathered♪

359
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:06,800
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

360
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:14,010
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

361
00:13:14,030 --> 00:13:17,560
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

362
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:27,470
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

363
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:30,730
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

364
00:13:31,020 --> 00:13:34,040
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

365
00:13:34,050 --> 00:13:35,730
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

366
00:13:35,770 --> 00:13:37,650
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

367
00:13:37,690 --> 00:13:39,210
♪I left my wife behind♪

368
00:13:39,350 --> 00:13:40,810
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

369
00:13:40,850 --> 00:13:44,630
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

370
00:13:44,690 --> 00:13:45,770
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

371
00:13:45,780 --> 00:13:47,870
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

372
00:13:47,910 --> 00:13:49,570
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

373
00:13:49,610 --> 00:13:51,440
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

374
00:13:51,470 --> 00:13:54,800
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

375
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:58,070
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

376
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:01,200
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

377
00:14:01,220 --> 00:14:04,570
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

378
00:14:04,620 --> 00:14:08,230
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

379
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:11,580
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

380
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:14,690
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

381
00:14:15,270 --> 00:14:18,320
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

382
00:14:18,340 --> 00:14:21,760
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

383
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:25,320
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

384
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:28,800
♪You're just wasting your time♪

385
00:14:28,850 --> 00:14:31,770
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

386
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:33,430
♪And I just laugh happily♪

387
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:36,840
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

